cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Bhoonidhi Explorer: plain-language discovery of ISRO Bhoonidhi satellite scenes"
abstract: >-
  Bhoonidhi Explorer finds satellite scenes in ISRO's Bhoonidhi archive from a
  question in plain words or a query form, shows them on a map, and hands off
  the commands that download them under the user's own Bhoonidhi login. It
  searches a STAC API over the archive's scene metadata, built by
  bhoonidhi-stac.
type: software
